# Statistical Significance Example (Aggregation)

This example demonstrates VCasT's `agg` mode on per-member significance input data: it
aggregates Model B's per-member 2m temperature data (`input_files/modelb-T2M.data`),
grouping by lead time and computing mean RMSE and bias across ensemble members. This is
the kind of aggregation step that typically feeds into a `significance` comparison like
the one in `ss-0001`.

## Command

```bash
# Aggregates modelb-T2M.data by fcst_lead -> agg.data
vcast config_agg.yaml
```
